WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two letters can appear on the same screen. You can report the first and miss the second.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Psychologists call this the attentional blink. Your eyes need not close.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A study of intensive meditation training found differences on a laboratory version of this task.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But that did not test a retail meditation recording—or promise a permanent change.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 sells short audio sessions. The format is a feature; the claimed brain effects are another question.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Start with the free twelve-minute baseline. Then check the evidence and exact offer before deciding.
